GIVETH AN a
`Article 6: deleted from 28 September 2021` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 6 of the Interpretation (Jersey) Law 1954 is deleted from 28 September 2021 (L.8/2021); it is not in the text of the Law in force on this day"

