GIVETH AN a
`Article 16: deleted from 28 September 2021` MEANS
    REFUSE "Article 16 of the Interpretation (Jersey) Law 1954 is deleted from 28 September 2021 (L.8/2021); it is not in the text of the Law in force on this day"

-- src:l_17_1954_20210927:73 | 17 Effect of repeal and re-enactment, and expiry
